'''Nidoran♀''' (Japanese: '''ニドラン♀''' ''Nidoran♀'') is a {{ct|Darkness}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

