==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Rising Rivals|Nidoran♀|71}} from the {{TCG|Rising Rivals}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Nidoran♀}}.
*'''Call for Family''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Jungle|Nidoran♀|57}} and {{TCG ID|Jungle|Bellsprout|49}}, both from the {{TCG|Jungle}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

